msgstr "Resistencia significativa enemiga."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:319
msgctxt "lost-comms"
msgid "We're pretty busy scanning for treasure... I mean, conducting research in this nebula. Can we call you back?"
msgstr "Estamos bastante ocupados buscando tesoros... es decir, realizando investigaciones en esta nebulosa. ¿Podemos llamarte de vuelta?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:339
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Just a hollow spherical apparition. Kinda looks like it's hiding something."
msgstr "Una aparición esférica hueca parece que esconde algo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:339
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "It seems to have changed shape."
msgstr "Parece haber cambiado de forma."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:347
msgctxt "nebulaBonuses-shipLog"
msgid "A Nuke and additional nuke storage have been added to our arsenal"
msgstr "Un Nuke y almacenamiento adicional de nuke se han añadido a nuestro arsenal"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:355
msgctxt "nebulaBonuses-shipLog"
msgid "A stranded repair crew has been rescued"
msgstr "Se ha rescatado a un equipo de reparación varado."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:363
msgctxt "nebulaBonuses-shipLog"
msgid "This scientific data is sure to raise our reputation with the eggheads."
msgstr "Estos datos científicos seguramente elevarán nuestra reputación con las cabezas de huevo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:370
msgctxt "nebulaBonuses-incCall"
msgid "DRONE SELF DEFENCE SYSTEM ACTIVATED"
msgstr "SISTEMA DE DEFENCIA SELF ACTIVA"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:371
msgctxt "nebulaBonuses-shipLog"
msgid "DRONE SELF DEFENCE SYSTEM ACTIVATED"
msgstr "SISTEMA DE DEFENCIA SELF ACTIVA"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:378
msgctxt "nebulaBonuses-shipLog"
msgid "We have activated a drone defence system!"
msgstr "¡Hemos activado un sistema de defensa de drones!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:796
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Greetings, Captain.\n"
"\n"
"You've been assigned a tour of duty in the Zeta Belt. It's neutral territory with a bit of everything... nebulae, asteroids, baby planets, and dangerous old scrap.\n"
"\n"
"We don't see many Kraylor around here, but we have a non-aggression treaty with them, so should you encounter any, think twice before engaging. The main security risk is from those damned Ghost and Exuari drones and that keep flying around.\n"
"\n"
"Your primary orders are to support all the research facilities in the area, both Human and Independent. Their safety must be guaranteed, including helping them with dangerous operations. If you can't find anything to do, check in here and we can set you up with a patrol route.\n"
"\n"
"Your ship, the Propitious 1, is well equipped but not exactly a war vessel, so conduct yourself carefully and try not to breach the peace tumultuously.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saludos, Capitán, le han asignado un recorrido de servicio en el Zeta Belt. Es territorio neutral con un poco de todo... nebulosa, asteroides, planetas bebés y vieja chatarra peligrosa. No vemos muchos Kraylor por aquí, pero tenemos un tratado de no agresión con ellos, así que si usted encuentra alguno, piense dos veces antes de comprometerse. El principal riesgo de seguridad es de esos malditos drones Ghost y Exuari y que siguen volando alrededor. Sus órdenes primarias son apoyar todas las instalaciones de investigación en la zona, tanto Humano como Independiente. Su seguridad debe ser garantizada, incluyendo ayudarles con operaciones peligrosas. Si no encuentra nada que hacer, consulte aquí y podemos configurarlo con una ruta de patrulla.\n"
"\n"
"Su barco, el Propitious 1, está bien equipado pero no exactamente un buque de guerra, por lo que conduzcan con cuidado y traten de no romper la paz con tumultuosa.\n"

