#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:848
msgctxt "buttonGM"
msgid "Patrol"
msgstr "Patrol"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:885
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Firing on invulnerable target"
msgstr "Firing on invulnerable target"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:888
msgctxt "wormhole-incCall"
msgid ""
"Captain, Stop!\n"
"\n"
"Don't waste your time shooting at that station. It has an Exuari emergency integrity field that will prevent catastrophic hull breach. Just a waste of energy, I promise you."
msgstr "Capitán, no pierda su tiempo disparando en esa estación. Tiene un campo de integridad de emergencia Exuari que evitará una brecha de casco catastrófico."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1034
msgctxt "defenceStnCheckpoint-IncCall"
msgid ""
"RED ALERT!\n"
"\n"
"The SW Checkpoint is under attack. Don't mess around, get down there and help them!"
msgstr "El punto de control SW está bajo ataque. ¡No te metas, baja ahí y ayúdelos!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1037
msgctxt "defenceStnCheckpoint-shipLog"
msgid "Defend the SW checkpoint"
msgstr "Defender el puesto de control SW"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1071
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"It looks like you've aggro'd the convoy.\n"
"Good luck to you! Try to keep them from destroying our stations!"
msgstr "Parece que has aggro'd el convoy. ¡Buena suerte para ti! ¡Intente evitar que destruyan nuestras estaciones!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1104
msgctxt "warning-shipLog"
msgid "This station appears immune to our attacks"
msgstr "Esta estación parece inmune a nuestros ataques"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1152
#, lua-format
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-shipLog"
msgid "We have lost %s reputation for breaking the treaty"
msgstr "Hemos perdido. %s reputación por romper el tratado"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1153
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-IncCall"
msgid ""
"You will regret this!\n"
"\n"
"You have violated our non-aggression treaty, and will soon regret your actions."
msgstr "¡Lo lamentarás! Has violado nuestro tratado de no agresión, y pronto lamentarás tus acciones."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1164
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Do not communicate on this channel."
msgstr "No te comuniques en este canal."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1168
msgctxt "drone-incCall"
msgid ""
"DISENGAGE!\n"
"\n"
"Captain, it's not what it looks like. Please dock with us and we will explain everything."
msgstr "Capitán, no es lo que parece."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1185
msgctxt "wormhole-incCall"
msgid ""
"RED ALERT!\n"
"\n"
"Captain, a bomb has just gone off on our station and we are under attack from the Kraylor. We need your help immediately!"
msgstr "Capitán, una bomba acaba de salir en nuestra estación y estamos bajo ataque del Kraylor. ¡Necesitamos su ayuda inmediatamente!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1188
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Defend the Wormhole Station"
msgstr "Defender la estación de Wormhole"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1231
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"Hello Captain. Have you noticed our cool wormhole?\n"
"\n"
"We're studying the energy radiating from the wormhole, and the similarities to black holes are astonishing. Please drop by if you'd like to help out."
msgstr "Hola Capitán. ¿Ha notado nuestro agujero de gusano fresco? Estamos estudiando la energía irradiando desde el agujero de gusano, y las similitudes con los agujeros negros son asombrosas. Por favor, pase por si quiere ayudar."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1236
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Please bring us the spare parts!"
msgstr "¡Por favor, tráenos las piezas de repuesto!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1238
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Thanks so much for your help!"
msgstr "¡Muchas gracias por tu ayuda!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1245
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"Thanks for dropping by, Captain.\n"
"\n"
"Our research is going well, but we could use some spare stabilizers for our Hawking Scanner. Would you mind salvaging some for us from the other side of the wormhole?"
msgstr "Gracias por venir, Capitán. Nuestra investigación va bien, pero podríamos usar algunos estabilizadores de repuesto para nuestro escáner de Hawking. ¿Le importaría salvar algunos para nosotros del otro lado del agujero de gusano?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1248
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Okay, we can help with that."
msgstr "Bien, podemos ayudar con eso."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1249
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Do you pay tips?"
msgstr "¿Pagas propinas?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1250
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Maybe later, then. Goodbye."
msgstr "Tal vez más tarde, entonces."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1258
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"Thanks for your help, Captain!\n"
"\n"
"These spare parts will really help with the program budget."
msgstr "Gracias por su ayuda, Capitán! Estas piezas de repuesto realmente ayudarán con el presupuesto del programa."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1261
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "What do we get for being your errand boy?"
msgstr "¿Qué obtenemos por ser tu chico de los recados?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1262
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "You get half of what would have with a smarter attitude! So rude."
msgstr "¡Tienes la mitad de lo que tendría con una actitud más inteligente!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1267
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "We're so glad we could help"
msgstr "Estamos tan contentos de poder ayudar."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1268
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "We are too. Thanks a bunch."
msgstr "Gracias a un montón."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1273
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "We still need those spare parts from X472 on the other side of the wormhole!"
msgstr "¡Todavía necesitamos esas piezas de repuesto de X472 en el otro lado del agujero de gusano!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1276
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Thanks that was awesome"
msgstr "Gracias que fue increíble"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1285
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "We're under attack. Help us!"
msgstr "Estamos bajo ataque. ¡Ayúdanos!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1291
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Come pick up our Hawking Scanner for repairs."
msgstr "Ven a buscar nuestro escáner de Hawking para reparaciones."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1293
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Please find someone to repair our Hawking Scanner."
msgstr "Por favor busca a alguien para reparar nuestro escáner de Hawking."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1299
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"Thanks again, Captain.\n"
"\n"
"We need you to find someone to repair this Hawking Scanner. Please bring it back once it's working again."
msgstr "Gracias de nuevo, capitán, necesitamos que encuentres a alguien para reparar este escáner de Hawking, por favor, devuélvelo una vez que esté funcionando de nuevo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1302
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Any idea where we should take it?"
msgstr "¿Alguna idea de dónde deberíamos tomarlo?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1303
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"One of the nebula researchers should be able to point you in the right direction.\n"
"\n"
"If you're not sure where to find them, ask for directions at the Admin Station"
msgstr "Uno de los investigadores de la nebulosa debe ser capaz de apuntarte en la dirección correcta. Si no estás seguro de dónde encontrarlos, pide direcciones en la estación de Admin"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1307
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Have you considered shoving it where the sun don't shine?"
msgstr "¿Has considerado empujarlo donde el sol no brilla?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1308
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "What is it with you, anyways?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa contigo, de todos modos?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1314
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"You got it fixed?\n"
"\n"
"That's amazing, Captain. Thank you so much! You and your crew are true heros of our system; may your names live on through history.\n"
"\n"
"Glory to you and your kin."
msgstr "¿Lo arreglaste? Eso es asombroso, Capitán. ¡Muchas gracias! Tú y tu tripulación son verdaderos héroes de nuestro sistema; que tus nombres vivan a través de la historia. Gloria a ti y a tus parientes."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1319
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "You're very welcome."
msgstr "De nada."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1320
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Goodbye captain. May peace be with you."
msgstr "Que la paz esté con usted."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1323
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "Kiss my feet!"
msgstr "¡Bésame los pies!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1327
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"I was about to call this in to Admin and have them declare you victorious, but I've had enough of you.\n"
"\n"
"YOU MAY BE A HERO, BUT YOU'RE ALSO A JERK!"
msgstr "Estaba a punto de llamar a Admin y hacer que te declaren victorioso, pero ya he tenido suficiente de ti. ¡Puedes ser un héroe, pero también eres un JERK!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1331
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "A real peach, you are."
msgstr "Un verdadero melocotón, lo eres."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1340
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid "Well, what I can do for you?"
msgstr "Bueno, ¿qué puedo hacer por ti?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1343
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid "We're looking for Dr. Hendrix"
msgstr "Buscamos al Dr. Hendrix."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1350
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid ""
"I.....zzzZ\n"
"Hello?\n"
"...\n"
"The nearby NeZula somzzzzzzimes messssssses with our long range commcommcommcomm somet...\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"....dock...pr...b..\n"
"...r"
msgstr "I.....zzzZ Hola? ... El cercano NeZula somzzzzimes mete con nuestra larga gama de comacommcommcomm somet ... ....dock ...pr ...b.."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1360
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid ""
"I am Dr. Hendrix.\n"
"\n"
"If I remember that voice correctly, you are the crew from the Navy ship that saved me when I was stranded in the nebula!\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr "Soy el Dr. Hendrix. Si recuerdo correctamente esa voz, eres la tripulación del barco de la Marina que me salvó cuando estaba varada en la nebulosa! ¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1365
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid "Can you fix this Hawking Scanner?"
msgstr "¿Puedes arreglar este escáner de Hawking?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1366
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid ""
"Let me have a look...\n"
"\n"
"Ah, I see why it's giving you trouble. Everything reads as okay, but the Graviton Lens is mis-calibrated somehow so it's throwing off the whole system.\n"
"\n"
"The good news is that it's easy to swap these out, the tech at the wormhole station should be able to do it. The bad news is that we have a shortage of Graviton Lenses right now because of those drone convoys.\n"
"\n"
"I've put in a requisition for one in your name. If you can find one in a Navy storehouse, bring it to the wormhole station and they should be good to go."
msgstr ""
"Déjame echar un vistazo... Ah, veo por qué te está dando problemas. Todo parece bien, pero el Graviton Lens está mal calibrado de alguna manera, así que está desperdiciando todo el sistema. La buena noticia es que es fácil cambiar esto, la tecnología de la estación de agujeros de gusano debe ser capaz de hacerlo. La mala noticia es que tenemos una escasez de Graviton Lenses drones ahora mismo debido a esos convoyes.\n"
"\n"
"He puesto una solicitud para uno en tu nombre. Si puedes encontrar uno en un almacén de la Marina, llévalo a la estación de agujeros de gusano y deberían ser buenos para ir."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1373
msgctxt "colony-shipLog"
msgid "Find a Graviton Lens"
msgstr "Encontrar un Graviton Lens"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1381
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid "Some filler text and whatever. What are we even doing here?"
msgstr "Un mensaje de relleno y lo que sea. ¿Qué hacemos aquí?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1382
msgctxt "colony-comms"
msgid "Dude, where even ARE we?"
msgstr "Amigo, ¿dónde estamos?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1388
msgctxt "checkpointsStn-comms"
msgid "Not much here bud, just doing checkpoint kinda things, ya know?"
msgstr "No hay mucho aquí amigo, sólo haciendo cosas de control, ¿sabes?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1395
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Defend the SW Checkpoint now!"
msgstr "¡Defiende el punto de control SW ahora!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1398
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"You are on 'patrol'.\n"
"See that you make it to %s next."
msgstr "Estás en 'patrol'. %s el siguiente."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1401
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Your orders are to follow the convoy to see where it goes"
msgstr "Tus órdenes son seguir al convoy para ver dónde va"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1404
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Your orders are to join a convoy and infiltrate the drone nests."
msgstr "Tus órdenes son unirte a un convoy e infiltrarte en los nidos de drones."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1407
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Your orders are to scan those beacons and find the defence grid controller"
msgstr "Sus órdenes son escanear esos balcones y encontrar el controlador de red de defensa"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1413
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "We are keeping the 007, and you can continue to fly it, or switch back to the Propitious 1 at any time. We'll keep it docked here at the station for you."
msgstr "Mantenemos el 007, y puedes seguir vuelando, o volver al Propitious 1 en cualquier momento. Lo mantendremos encerrado aquí en la estación para ti."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1415
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Great work, Captain!\n"
"Destroying the central control eliminated all the other drone stations and stopped the convoys in their tracks! Of course, you are authorized to mop up any resistance that might remain, but we're calling this a job well done.\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"¡Gran trabajo, Capitán! Destruir el control central eliminó todas las otras estaciones de drones y detuvo a los convoyes en sus pistas! Por supuesto, usted está autorizado a burlar cualquier resistencia que pueda permanecer, pero estamos llamando a este un trabajo bien hecho.\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1422
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Good day, soldier.\n"
"\n"
"We shouldn't talk over this channel, please dock to the station when you have a chance."
msgstr "Buen día, soldado, no deberíamos hablar de este canal, por favor, agárrate a la estación cuando tengas una oportunidad."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1428
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Welcome aboard.\n"
"\n"
"We need you to patrol the area. It's not exciting work, but it's got to be done. No rush, just make sure you visit each checkpoint in order, and we'll let you know if anything more pressing comes up."
msgstr "Bienvenida a bordo, necesitamos que patrulles la zona, no es un trabajo emocionante, pero tiene que ser hecho. No hay prisa, sólo asegúrate de visitar cada punto de control en orden, y te avisaremos si algo más apremiante aparece."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1431
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Okay. We're ready to start the patrol"
msgstr "Estamos listos para empezar la patrulla."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1435
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, Captain.\n"
"\n"
"We've tracked that convoy to a huge nest of drone stations in the west. The stations all form part of one proximity defence grid, and we have identified some beacons that appear to be related to its operation. We're hoping that if we can get a closer look at them, we might be able to figure out how to knock out the central control.\n"
"\n"
"There is a drone ship docked here which you can use to infiltrate the nests. If you arrive with a convoy, you should automatically be granted access and we think the proximity defences will remain disabled while you stay in the area. Of course, if you start firing, then all bets are probably off.\n"
"\n"
"Hop in that drone ship, find the beacons, and get close enough to scan them - EASY!"
msgstr ""
"Bienvenida, Capitán, hemos rastreado ese convoy a un enorme nido de estaciones de drones en el oeste. Las estaciones forman parte de una red de defensa de proximidad, y hemos identificado algunos balizas que parecen estar relacionadas con su operación. Esperamos que si podemos echar un vistazo más cerca de ellos, podríamos ser capaces de averiguar cómo eliminar el control central.\n"
"\n"
"Hay un barco de drones atracado aquí que se puede utilizar para infiltrar los nidos. Si llegas con un convoy, se debe conceder automáticamente el acceso y pensamos que las defensas de proximidad permanecerán deshabilitadas mientras te quedas en la zona. Por supuesto, si empiezas a disparar, entonces todas las apuestas están probablemente apagadas. Suba en ese barco de drones, encuentra los balizas, y acercate lo suficiente para escanearlos - ¡EASY!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1442
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "We're ready to infiltrate the drone nest"
msgstr "Estamos listos para infiltrarnos en el nido de drones."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1443
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "(Object) Isn't that a treaty violation!?"
msgstr "¿No es una violación de un tratado?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1444
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"(Objecting)\n"
"Sir, decoding the communications of alien defence systems is a violation of the Deepspace Militarized Citizenry Accord (DMCA).\n"
"[...]\n"
"Captain, are you angling for a good samaritan's award or something? Get out of here with that legal mumbo-jumbo.\n"
"\n"
"However you want to do it, you need to find that central control. Get on it!"
msgstr "Señor, decodificar las comunicaciones de los sistemas de defensa alienígena es una violación del Acuerdo de Ciudadanía Militar Profundo (DMCA). [...] Capitán, ¿está usted anhelando un buen premio de samaritano o algo así? Sal de aquí con ese mumbo legal. Sin embargo, usted quiere hacerlo, usted necesita encontrar ese control central. ¡Adelante!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1450
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Okay, we'll figure it out."
msgstr "Bien, lo averiguaremos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1455
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Great job on that drone nest, Captain.\n"
"\n"
"Remember, your primary orders are to support the research facilities in the area. See to it that they all get the assistance they need."
msgstr "Gran trabajo en ese nido de drones, Capitán. Recuerde, sus órdenes primarias son apoyar las instalaciones de investigación en la zona. Asegúrese de que todos reciben la asistencia que necesitan."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1460
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "We'd rather crew the Propitious 1"
msgstr "Preferiríamos tripular el Propitious 1"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1463 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1471
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Very well. Good Hunting."
msgstr "Muy bien, buena caza."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1467
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "We'd rather crew the DD007"
msgstr "Preferiríamos tripular el DD007"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1484
#, lua-format
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid ""
"VICTORY!\n"
"Your tour of duty is complete and your accomplishments will be the talk of legends.\n"
"CHEEVOS!\n"
"* Experienced treasure hunter - %s\n"
"* Clean up the useless space junk - %s\n"
"* Historical relic preservation - %s\n"
"* Social distancing - %s\n"
"* Our ship is all we need - %s\n"
"* No DMCA violations - %s\n"
"* I ain't afraid of no ghosts - %s\n"
"* Keep an eye on that doctor - %s\n"
"* Ban wormhole research - %s\n"
"* Heros for the ages - %s\n"
"* Grand slam - %s"
msgstr ""
"VICTORIA! Su recorrido por el deber está completo y sus logros serán la charla de leyendas. CHEEVOS! * Cazador de tesoros experimentado - %s\n"
"* Limpiar la basura espacial inútil - %s\n"
"* Conservación histórica de la reliquia - %s\n"
"* Social distancing - %s\n"
"* Nuestra nave es todo lo que necesitamos... %s\n"
"* No DMCA violations - %s\n"
"* No tengo miedo de ningún fantasma... %s\n"
"* Vigila a ese doctor... %s\n"
"* Investigación del agujero de gusano de la banca - %s\n"
"* Heros para las edades - %s\n"
"* Grand slam... %s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1485
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Hints for each CHEEVO"
msgstr "Hints para cada CHEEVO"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1486
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Select the achievement for a hint"
msgstr "Seleccione el logro para una pista"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1487
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Experienced treasure hunter"
msgstr "Cazador de tesoros experimentado"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1488
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "The locals are known to hunt treasure in the nebula"
msgstr "Los lugareños son conocidos por cazar tesoros en la nebulosa"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1489 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1493 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1497 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1501 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1505 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1509 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1513 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1517 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1521 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1525 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1529 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1569 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1573 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1579 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1583 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1587 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1635 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1639 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1649 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1654
msgid "<- Back"
msgstr "■- Atrás"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1491
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Clean up the space junk"
msgstr "Limpiar la basura espacial"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1492
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "So many long abandoned stations"
msgstr "Tantas estaciones abandonadas"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1495
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Historical relic preservation"
msgstr "Conservación de reliquias históricas"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1496
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Destroying that old station might spook the Kraylor"
msgstr "Destruir esa vieja estación podría asustar al Kraylor"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1499
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Social distancing"
msgstr "Social distancing"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1500
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Don't get too proximate"
msgstr "No te pongas demasiado proximado."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1503
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Our ship is all we need"
msgstr "Nuestra nave es todo lo que necesitamos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1504
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "We'll stick with the ship we know, thanks"
msgstr "Nos quedaremos con la nave que conocemos, gracias."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1507
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "No DMCA violations"
msgstr "No DMCA violations"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1508
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Hacking alien defense systems is illegal"
msgstr "Hacking sistemas de defensa alienígena es ilegal"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1511
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "I ain't afraid of no ghosts"
msgstr "No tengo miedo de ningún fantasma."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1512
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "No one is afraid if there are NO GHOSTS"
msgstr "Nadie tiene miedo si no hay GHOSTS"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1515
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Keep an eye on that doctor"
msgstr "Vigila a ese doctor."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1516
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Do we really need to ask for directions?"
msgstr "¿De verdad necesitamos pedir direcciones?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1519
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Ban wormhole research"
msgstr "Investigación de agujeros de gusano"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1520
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "I just can't stand wormholes, or their researchers!"
msgstr "¡No puedo soportar los agujeros de gusano, ni sus investigadores!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1523
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Heros for the ages"
msgstr "Heros para las edades"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1524
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Their reputation is unmatched"
msgstr "Su reputación no es igual."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1527
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Grand Slam"
msgstr "Grand Slam"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1528
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "You can do it, but can you do it ALL?"
msgstr "Puedes hacerlo, pero ¿puedes hacerlo TODO?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1532
msgctxt "adminStnEnd-comms"
msgid "Click here to lance the champagne!"
msgstr "¡Haz clic aquí para lanzar el champán!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1533
msgctxt "adminStnEnd-comms"
msgid "Booyah!!!"
msgstr "¡Booyah!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1541
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"We are the station that co-ordinates research activities in the nearby nebulae.\n"
"\n"
"If you're not busy, please drop by to learn more about our projects."
msgstr "Somos la estación que coordina las actividades de investigación en las nebulosas cercanas. Si no estás ocupado, por favor pasa a aprender más sobre nuestros proyectos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1545 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1559
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Please bring our researchers home!"
msgstr "¡Por favor, trae a nuestros investigadores a casa!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1547
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Thanks so much for finding our researchers! Dock with us if you'd like to chat."
msgstr "Muchas gracias por encontrar a nuestros investigadores. Hágase con nosotros si quiere charlar."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1552
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "We are so glad to have you aboard. What can we help you with?"
msgstr "Estamos tan contentos de tenerte a bordo. ¿Con qué podemos ayudarte?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1553 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1567
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "How long have you been operating in this system?"
msgstr "¿Cuánto tiempo llevas operando en este sistema?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1554 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1571
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Where is the colony where your researchers live?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está la colonia donde viven sus investigadores?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1555 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1575
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Tell us about the nearby nebulae."
msgstr "Cuéntanos sobre la nebulosa cercana."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1556 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1581
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Are there any Kraylor in the area?"
msgstr "¿Hay algún Kraylor en la zona?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1557 scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1585
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Are there any Exuari in the area?"
msgstr "¿Hay algún Exuari en la zona?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1561
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Always a pleasure to have you as our honoured guests."
msgstr "Siempre es un placer tenerte como invitados honrados."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1563
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Any idea where we can get a Hawking Scanner fixed?"
msgstr "¿Alguna idea de dónde podemos arreglar un escáner de Hawking?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1564
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Dr. Hendrix, who you rescued earlier, is the leading expert on those scanners."
msgstr "El Dr. Hendrix, quien rescató antes, es el experto líder en esos escáneres."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1568
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "We have been operating here for about 50 years"
msgstr "Hemos estado operando aquí por unos 50 años."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1572
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "You'll find it to the east of the nebulae"
msgstr "Lo encontrarás al este de la nebulosa."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1576
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Well I suppose you already know about the nebulae. They are to the north.\n"
"\n"
"Did you know that it's a popular place to hunt for treasure?"
msgstr "Supongo que ya sabes lo de la nebulosa, están al norte. ¿Sabías que es un lugar popular para cazar tesoros?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1582
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "We see some from time to time, but with the non-aggression treaty, they haven't been too much trouble."
msgstr "Vemos algunos de vez en cuando, pero con el tratado de no agresión, no han sido demasiados problemas."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1586
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Old space junk, mostly. We haven't seen any real Exauri activity in decades."
msgstr "No hemos visto ninguna actividad de Exauri en décadas."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1595
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid ""
"Come in? Dr. Hendrix here... Come in?\n"
"\n"
"Oh thank heavens, we're found! We thought we might be stuck here for good!\n"
"\n"
"We need to install a new hyperplasma full bridge rectifier, but our plasma conduit driver has gone missing. You must have one in your engine room? If you let us borrow it, we will upgrade your sensors with our new experimental modifications."
msgstr "Dr. Hendrix aquí... ¿Entra? Gracias a Dios, nos han encontrado! Pensamos que podríamos estar atrapados aquí por el bien! Necesitamos instalar un nuevo rectificador de puentes completos de hiperplasma, pero nuestro conductor de conducto de plasma ha desaparecido. ¿Debe tener uno en su sala de motor? Si nos deja tomarlo, actualizaremos sus sensores con nuestras nuevas modificaciones experimentales."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1600
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid "Sure, you can borrow our conduit driver!"
msgstr "Claro, ¡puedes pedir prestado nuestro conductor de conducto!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1601
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid ""
"Great. Your sensors are upgraded. We'll get this rectifier installed and be on our way.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks again, Captain. If you ever need some help with your Hawking Scanners, look me up!"
msgstr "Bien, sus sensores están actualizados, vamos a instalar este rectificador y estar en nuestro camino. Gracias de nuevo, Capitán. Si alguna vez necesita ayuda con sus escáneres de Hawking, míreme hacia arriba!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1609
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid "Thanks so much for finding us!"
msgstr "¡Muchas gracias por encontrarnos!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1614
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "What do you have to say for yourself?"
msgstr "¿Qué tienes que decir por ti mismo?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1615
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "We're just running a salvage mission."
msgstr "Sólo estamos dirigiendo una misión de rescate."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1616
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "Carry on, then, we're keeping our eye on you."
msgstr "Continúe, entonces, estamos vigilando a usted."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1618
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "Back off, this is a special military operation"
msgstr "Retrocede, esta es una operación militar especial"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1619
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "You want to back up that escalation with some weapons fire?"
msgstr "¿Quieres apoyar esa escalada con un fuego de armas?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1625
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"We oversee the B-3 liquidation of the Ghosts assets.\n"
"\n"
"Dock with us to check out what we've got."
msgstr "Supervisamos la liquidación B-3 de los activos de Ghosts."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1629
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"You need any of this stuff?\n"
"\n"
"It's not for sale, as such. You'll need to get a requisition from the Admin Station in order to carry anything out.\n"
msgstr "¿Necesitas algo de esto? No está a la venta, como tal. Necesitarás obtener una solicitud de la estación de Admin para llevar a cabo cualquier cosa.\n"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1633
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Proximity Sensor"
msgstr "Sensor de proximidad"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1634
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Activates when ships get too close"
msgstr "Activa cuando las naves se acercan demasiado"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1637
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Intelligence Accelerator"
msgstr "Intelligence Accelerator"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1638
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Too expensive to use for video games."
msgstr "Demasiado caro para usar para videojuegos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1641
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Graviton Lens"
msgstr "Graviton Lens"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1644
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, a requisition!\n"
"\n"
"Alright, enjoy... focusing your gravitons, I guess!"
msgstr "¡Ooooh, una requisa! ¡Bien, disfruta... centrando tus gravitones, supongo!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1648
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "For focusing the gravitational field."
msgstr "Para enfocar el campo gravitacional."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1652
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Holographic Projector"
msgstr "Holographic Projector"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1653
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Shows very convincing drone stations"
msgstr "Muestra estaciones de drones muy convincentes"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1662
#, lua-format
msgctxt "attack-incCall"
msgid ""
"HELP!\n"
"We are taking damage from %s and might need assistance."
msgstr "¡Ayúdenme! %s y tal vez necesite ayuda."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1666
#, lua-format
msgctxt "attack-shipLog"
msgid "%s is taking damage!"
msgstr "%s ¡Está haciendo daño!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1693
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Sorry to interrupt, but we've just recieved an urgent call.\n"
"\n"
"It seems one of our researchers, Dr. Hendrix, and her crew have lost their way in a nearby nebula and need our help. They were running experiments in the nebula when their engines and transponder went offline. Please follow our scout vessel, SR7, to the nebula and search for them."
msgstr "Siento interrumpir, pero acabamos de recibir una llamada urgente. Parece que uno de nuestros investigadores, Dr. Hendrix, y su equipo han perdido su camino en una nebulosa cercana y necesitan nuestra ayuda. Estaban realizando experimentos en la nebulosa cuando sus motores y transpondedores se apagaron. Por favor, siga nuestro barco de explorador, SR7, a la nebulosa y busque por ellos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1700
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Meet me at the edge of the nebula"
msgstr "Nos vemos en el borde de la nebulosa"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1718
msgctxt "adminStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Ready to head in?\n"
"\n"
"The nebula is very thick, so we will need to get close to find a ship with no transponder. Probes won't show the ship, but your relay station should be able to pick it up at 20U or less. There may be hazards, so be careful.\n"
"\n"
"I'll follow you. Let's find Dr. Hendrix and bring her crew home."
msgstr "¿Listo para entrar? La nebulosa es muy gruesa, por lo que tendremos que acercarnos para encontrar un barco sin transpondedor. Las sondas no mostrarán el barco, pero su estación de relé debe ser capaz de recogerlo a 20U o menos. Puede haber peligros, así que tenga cuidado. Voy a seguirle. Vamos a encontrar a la Dra. Hendrix y traer a su tripulación a casa."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1723
msgctxt "adminStn-shipLog"
msgid "Fly into the Nebula and find Dr. Hendrix"
msgstr "Volar a la Nebula y encontrar al Dr. Hendrix"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1746
msgctxt "finishMissionNebulae-shipLog"
msgid "Sensors have been upgraded."
msgstr "Se han mejorado los sensores."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1788
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Great!\n"
"\n"
"Start at the checkpoint in the North West. You'll need to dock at each station before proceeding to the next."
msgstr "¡Genial! Comience en el puesto de control en el noroeste. Tendrá que atracar en cada estación antes de proceder a la siguiente."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1819
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid "Please proceed to %s"
msgstr "Por favor, proceda. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1820
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Please proceed to %s"
msgstr "Por favor, proceda. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1839
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great work captain!\n"
"\n"
"You have repelled the attackers and the SW Checkpoint is safe for now, but intelligence reports show a huge drone convoy in your vicinity to the NW.\n"
"\n"
"INVESTIGATE BUT DO NOT ENGAGE! We have it on good word that attacking this convoy is extremely risky. Keep your distance, but we'd like to know where they are going."
msgstr "Gran capitán de trabajo! Usted ha repelled los atacantes y el SW Checkpoint es seguro por ahora, pero los informes de inteligencia muestran un enorme convoy de drones en sus proximidades a la NW. INVESTIGATE PERO NO ENGAGE! Tenemos en buena palabra que atacar este convoy es extremadamente arriesgado. Mantenga su distancia, pero nos gustaría saber a dónde van."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1844
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Investigate the convoy, but DO NOT ENGAGE"
msgstr "Investiga el convoy, pero NO ENGAGE"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1874
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Come in, Captain.\n"
"We have the info we need about that convoy and strongly discourage any further engagement.\n"
"Your assistance is required with a secret mission. Dock with us to receive further instructions when you're ready."
msgstr "Entra, capitán. Tenemos la información que necesitamos sobre ese convoy y desalentamos fuertemente cualquier compromiso adicional. Su asistencia es necesaria con una misión secreta. Atraque con nosotros para recibir instrucciones adicionales cuando esté listo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1875
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Dock with the Defence Station to start another mission"
msgstr "Dock with the Defence Station to start another mission"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1918
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "and when in doubt - apply missiles."
msgstr "y cuando en duda - aplicar misiles."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1920
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "and we've given you some extra missiles to help get the job done."
msgstr "y te hemos dado algunos misiles adicionales para ayudar a hacer el trabajo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1923
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "and go find some extra missiles to help get the job done."
msgstr "y buscar algunos misiles adicionales para ayudar a hacer el trabajo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1926
#, lua-format
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"Great!\n"
"There is an old Exuari station, callsign X472, to the SE on the other side of the wormhole. It used to study the planet forming nearby, but it's been abandoned for over a century now, no one aboard and no weapons, a historical relic, really. We need you to demolish it and bring us the stabilizers from its jump drive which we can use to maintain our Hawking Scanners.\n"
"We have hacked the emergency integrity field so that the station can be destroyed, but there were strange disturbances when we deactivated it. We're not sure what it means, but we advise you to exercise caution...\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"¡Genial! Hay una antigua estación de Exuari, llamada X472, al SE en el otro lado del agujero de gusano. Solía estudiar el planeta formando cerca, pero ha sido abandonado por más de un siglo ahora, nadie a bordo y ninguna arma, una reliquia histórica, realmente. Necesitamos que la demolición y nos traiga los estabilizadores de su unidad de salto que podemos utilizar para mantener nuestros escáneres de Hawking.\n"
"Hemos hackeado el campo de integridad de emergencia para que la estación pueda ser destruida, pero hubo perturbaciones extrañas cuando lo desactivamos. No estamos seguros de lo que significa, pero le aconsejamos que ejercite cautela...\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1943
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-incCall"
msgid ""
"Ugh, humans.\n"
"\n"
"This is the Kraylor Advanced \"Reasearch\" Project Agency (KARPA), we have detected your suspicious activity in the vicinity.\n"
"\n"
"We are sending a team to investigate what you are up to. If you fire on us, there will be trouble!"
msgstr "Esto es la Agencia de Proyectos de \"Investigación\" Avanzada de Kraylor (KARPA), hemos detectado su actividad sospechosa en los alrededores. Estamos enviando un equipo para investigar lo que está haciendo. Si nos dispara, habrá problemas!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1948
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-shipLog"
msgid "The Kraylor are investigating our activities and have warned us not to escalate"
msgstr "El Kraylor está investigando nuestras actividades y nos ha advertido que no escalamos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1954
msgctxt "wormhole-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great, you got the parts!\n"
"\n"
"You'd better hurry back, we've seen some Kraylor activity in the area. Hopefully your salvage mission didn't attract the wrong sort of attention."
msgstr "¡Genial, tienes las partes! Será mejor que te des prisa, hemos visto alguna actividad de Kraylor en la zona. Espero que tu misión de rescate no haya atraído el tipo equivocado de atención."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1958
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Return the spare parts to the Wormhole Station"
msgstr "Devuelve las piezas de repuesto a la estación de Wormhole"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1970
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Jump Defence Activated"
msgstr "Jump Defence Activated"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1995
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-incCall"
msgid ""
"Watch your back, Hugh Mon!\n"
"\n"
"We don't know what you're up to, but we don't like the look of it. Keep your distance and maybe we'll leave you alone.\n"
"\n"
"<The Kraylor Vessel jumps back through the wormhole>"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuidado, Hugh Mon! No sabemos lo que estás tramando, pero no nos gusta el aspecto de ello. Mantenga su distancia y tal vez le dejemos en paz.\n"
"\n"
"<The Kraylor Vessel jumps back through the wormhole>"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2000
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-shipLog"
msgid "The Kraylor seem hostile and have warned us to keep our distance"
msgstr "El Kraylor parece hostil y nos ha advertido que mantengamos nuestra distancia."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2031
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Good luck"
msgstr "Buena suerte."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2062
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid "Arrived, scan the security beacons"
msgstr "Llegada, escanea las balizas de seguridad"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2066
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid "Your cover has been blown and the proximity defence system remains active. We suggest leaving and trying again to arrive with a future convoy."
msgstr "Su cubierta ha sido soplada y el sistema de defensa de proximidad sigue activo. Sugerimos salir e intentar volver a llegar con un futuro convoy."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2067
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Our cover has been blown"
msgstr "Nuestra tapadera ha sido volada"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2072
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "We should be good to try again"
msgstr "Deberíamos ser buenos para intentarlo de nuevo."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2106
msgctxt "drone-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great work, Captain!\n"
"\n"
"We have taken control of this station and will be liquidating spare parts from the wreckage."
msgstr "¡Gran trabajo, Capitán! Hemos tomado el control de esta estación y vamos a liquidar piezas de repuesto de los restos."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2109
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "DB-3 has a collection of spare parts"
msgstr "DB-3 tiene una colección de piezas de repuesto"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2188
msgctxt "wormhole-incCall"
msgid ""
"Thanks so much, captain!\n"
"\n"
"You really saved our ass there. Unfortunately our Hawking Scanner was damaged by the bomb, and we haven't been able to get it back online. Do you think you could get it fixed for us?\n"
"\n"
"Please dock with us to pick up the scanner."
msgstr "Muchas gracias, capitán! Realmente nos salvaste el culo allí. Desafortunadamente nuestro Hawking Scanner fue dañado por la bomba, y no hemos sido capaces de conseguirlo de vuelta en línea. ¿Crees que podría arreglarlo para nosotros? Por favor, agárrenos para recoger el escáner."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2193
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Get the Hawking Scanner from the Wormhole Station"
msgstr "Consigue el escáner de Hawking de la estación de Wormhole"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2248
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "This ship will not activate the drone station proximity defences as long as you arrive with a convoy."
msgstr "Este barco no activará las defensas de proximidad de la estación de drones mientras llegue con un convoy."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2252
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "It's nice to be back aboard the Propitious 1"
msgstr "Es agradable estar de vuelta a bordo del Propitious 1"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2285
msgctxt "drone-incCall"
msgid "PROXIMITY DEFENCE SYSTEM ACTIVATED"
msgstr "PROXIMITY DEFENCE SYSTEM ACTIVATED"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2286
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "We got too close to a drone station and it launched defences."
msgstr "Nos acercamos demasiado a una estación de drones y lanzó defensas."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2297
msgctxt "scienceDescription-beacons"
msgid "The Ghosts drone security beacons. If we scan them all, we should be able to find the control station. We'll need to get pretty close."
msgstr "Los faros de seguridad de Ghosts drones, si los escaneamos a todos, deberíamos poder encontrar la estación de control."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2305
msgctxt "scienceDescription-beacons"
msgid "The beamforming configuration from this beacon will help the boffins triangulate the location of the central control."
msgstr "La configuración de rayos de este faro ayudará a los boffins a triangular la ubicación del control central."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2314
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great work!\n"
"Our boffins were able to piece together the data and figure out where the commands are coming from.\n"
"You must destroy station %s"
msgstr "¡Gran trabajo! Nuestros ataúdes fueron capaces de reunir los datos y averiguar de dónde vienen los comandos. Debes destruir la estación %s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2315
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "The drone control station is %s"
msgstr "La estación de control de drones es %s"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2384
msgctxt "newShip-comms"
msgid "Too busy to talk today, Captain."
msgstr "Demasiado ocupado para hablar hoy, Capitán."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2393
msgctxt "hendrixHints-comms"
msgid "Sorry, I don't know where Dr. Hendrix lives"
msgstr "Lo siento, no sé dónde vive el Dr. Hendrix."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2401
#, lua-format
msgctxt "hendrixHints-comms"
msgid "Dr. Hendrix, of course! I'm pretty sure she was on a %s-class station, but darned if I can remember which one."
msgstr "Dr. Hendrix, por supuesto. %s- estación de clase, pero se atrevió si puedo recordar cuál."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2403
#, lua-format
msgctxt "hendrixHints-comms"
msgid "Gosh, Dr. Hendrix. Okay. Sorry, but honestly all I remember is that her address definitely has a '%s' in it."
msgstr "Lo siento, pero honestamente todo lo que recuerdo es que su dirección definitivamente tiene un '%s'en ella."

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2410
msgctxt "defeat-shipLog"
msgid "DEFEAT - A Patrol Station has been destroyed"
msgstr "DEFEAT - Una estación de patrullas ha sido destruida"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2417
msgctxt "defeat-shipLog"
msgid "DEFEAT - A Core station (Admin, Defence, Wormhole) has been destroyed"
msgstr "DEFEAT - Una estación central (Admin, Defence, Wormhole) ha sido destruida"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2424
msgctxt "defeat-shipLog"
msgid "DEFEAT - Station B-3 has been destroyed"
msgstr "DEFEAT - La estación B-3 ha sido destruida"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2512
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "SUCCESS!!!"
msgstr "SUCESTA!"

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2514
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "INCOMPLETE"
msgstr "INCOMPLETE"
